2516+ 6A03 E1                   pop     hl
2517+ 6A04 B7                   or      a                       ;NC = valid page
2518+ 6A05 C9                   ret
2519+ 6A06              DIR128_MAP_BAD:
2520+ 6A06 D1                   pop     de
2521+ 6A07 E1                   pop     hl
2522+ 6A08 37                   scf
2523+ 6A09 C9                   ret
