2536+ 6A18              ;HL++ across #FFFF -> #C000 of the next directory page.
2537+ 6A18              ;IMPORTANT: A is preserved. OUT: NC=OK, C=end of directory RAM.
2538+ 6A18              DIR128_INC_HL:
2539+ 6A18 F5                   push    af                      ;old INC HL never changed A - preserve it here too
2540+ 6A19 23                   inc     hl
