2820+ 6B36              ; search_by_Busy_dir_slow
2821+ 6B36              ; Fully bank-safe fallback. It is used only when a file name itself crosses a
2822+ 6B36              ; #FFFF -> #C000 directory-page boundary. Such names are rare, so paging cost
